            <tr><td>Law that drives EOE concept</td><td>Constitution (Art. 16), RPwD Act 2016, Transgender Act 2019, judicial precedents.</td><td>Civil Rights Act 1964, ADEA, ADA, GINA.</td><td>EU Employment Equality Directive, national laws (Equality Act 2010 in UK, AGG in Germany).</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Does it apply to private firms?</td><td>Partially — specifically for disability & transgender protection; general EOE encouraged.</td><td>Yes (15+ employees).</td><td>Yes, with thresholds varying.</td></tr>
